    "Description": "A vulnerability in `libheif`, used by the default Sharp image service in Astro, can lead to remote code execution when a malicious AVIF image is optimized.\n\nProjects are affected when an attacker can cause Astro to process an untrusted AVIF image.\n\nThe fix was released in Astro 7.2.8, which requires Sharp 0.35.4.",
